      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 FL2V — replace the VIDEO DECODER only\nfl2va DiT; 1344x768, 124 frames, 24 FPS, 20 base steps. No turbo LoRA.\n\nThe original H3 video VAE directly encodes the first and last frames. Load H3 LightVAE feeds only VAE Decode: keep encoder = none, choose the Lite decoder, or decoder = none for a baseline.\n\nUpload first_frame.png and last_frame.png. Disconnect last_frame for I2V; disconnect both for T2V. Audio VAE stays original. Seed 42 is fixed for comparisons."
      ]
